WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.680
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.760 --> 01:40.920
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:52.680 --> 01:53.920
Her primordial spirit is very fragile.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.680
Once the stripping process is interrupted,

01:55.760 --> 01:57.560
she will be in danger of falling apart.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.640
The process is unbearably painful.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.760
No matter what, you must persevere.

02:01.840 --> 02:03.320
You must not have any distractions.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.400
Do you hear me?

02:05.080 --> 02:07.080
This is nothing

02:08.520 --> 02:10.240
compared to what she went through for me.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.440
Let's start.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.240
Hang in there.

02:57.320 --> 02:58.200
You're almost there.

03:03.560 --> 03:05.480
Dongfang Qingcang, what's wrong?

03:08.280 --> 03:09.120
Dongfang Qingcang.

04:00.560 --> 04:02.680
The first God of War, Lady Chidi,
has come back to life.

04:03.200 --> 04:04.800
I have to go back to Shuiyuntian.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.680
Stay at Xishan
and guard her transformation.

04:08.760 --> 04:09.840
I'll be back soon.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.120
You don't have to tell me.

04:12.360 --> 04:14.280
I will guard her with my life.

05:59.600 --> 06:00.720
By the way,

06:00.800 --> 06:02.240
I forgot to tell you.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.440
I saw your master.

06:05.200 --> 06:06.760
And I know where she lives.

06:08.520 --> 06:09.920
Don't you miss her a lot?

06:11.520 --> 06:13.080
Grow up.

06:13.680 --> 06:14.560
Grow up fast.

06:15.080 --> 06:16.240
When you come back,

06:16.960 --> 06:18.840
I will take you to visit her, all right?

06:23.040 --> 06:25.320
Your master also knew
that I made a mistake.

06:26.320 --> 06:27.480
She was also pissed

06:29.040 --> 06:30.480
and beat me up

06:31.360 --> 06:32.440
for you.

06:34.400 --> 06:35.880
You two

06:36.800 --> 06:38.480
have totally different temperaments.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.120
You are much gentler than her.

06:52.080 --> 06:53.160
Orchid.

07:14.760 --> 07:18.160
One, two, three,

07:19.080 --> 07:21.400
four, five,

07:22.080 --> 07:23.040
six.

07:32.080 --> 07:33.000
Orchid.

07:33.760 --> 07:35.960
Are you still blaming me

07:36.040 --> 07:37.480
and angry with me?

07:40.960 --> 07:42.720
I've been watching you for so long.

07:44.240 --> 07:46.360
Why did you only grow six leaves?

07:49.880 --> 07:51.600
I already know I'm wrong.

07:53.640 --> 07:55.320
Come back soon, all right?

08:20.520 --> 08:21.480
It's a nice day.

08:22.200 --> 08:24.120
I'm sure you can grow the ninth leaf.

08:29.880 --> 08:31.440
I'll get some dew for you.

08:32.080 --> 08:33.320
Wait for me here.

09:19.920 --> 09:20.800
Old friend,

09:21.400 --> 09:23.040
we meet again.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.800
God Xuanwu.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.280
It has been a long time.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.400
It seems that

09:29.480 --> 09:32.160
you have found your destiny.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.720
Thank you for your guidance.

09:37.280 --> 09:38.800
I'm ready.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.920
If you wake up as Goddess Xiyun,

09:42.000 --> 09:45.000
you'll have nothing to do
with all the past events

09:45.080 --> 09:47.120
of your life as Orchid.

09:47.640 --> 09:50.680
Can you really let go
of all the sorrow and happiness?

09:50.760 --> 09:53.600
You once instructed me
about the mission of the Goddess.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.240
But I was too ignorant

09:57.320 --> 09:58.640
to understand it at that time.

09:59.800 --> 10:00.720
Now

10:02.320 --> 10:04.000
I've seen what I should have seen

10:05.440 --> 10:06.400
and lost

10:08.120 --> 10:09.560
what was meant to be lost.

10:11.640 --> 10:14.040
I understand
what love and pain really are,

10:15.800 --> 10:17.360
what to pick up,

10:18.320 --> 10:19.800
and what to put down.

10:21.880 --> 10:22.920
From now on,

10:23.480 --> 10:25.800
I will no longer indulge
in private sorrow and joy.

10:28.240 --> 10:30.960
I will take up the mission of blessing
all beings in the three realms.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.960
I once said

10:33.560 --> 10:35.280
you are gifted

10:35.360 --> 10:38.440
and are more extraordinary
than all generations of Goddesses.

10:39.240 --> 10:42.320
I never understood this.

10:42.880 --> 10:46.600
The Goddesses of all generations
have been guarding Xishan all their lives.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.640
Although they believed in
the same mission as you,

10:49.720 --> 10:53.480
they failed to see all beings in the end.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.760
But you

10:55.840 --> 10:57.720
have traveled all over Shuiyuntian,

10:57.800 --> 11:00.400
Yunmeng Lake and Cangyan Sea.

11:01.320 --> 11:03.640
You have more than a mission
for all beings,

11:04.240 --> 11:05.880
but also true love.

11:06.880 --> 11:09.800
You'll create

11:09.880 --> 11:12.120
a new and fascinating world

11:12.920 --> 11:14.720
as the first Goddess did.

11:17.000 --> 11:17.960
Go.

13:04.640 --> 13:05.600
Ma'am!

13:08.440 --> 13:09.440
From now on,

13:10.000 --> 13:12.280
you'll be an ordinary spirit
in the three realms.

13:12.840 --> 13:15.760
Even if you and your relatives meet,
you will not know each other.

13:15.840 --> 13:18.520
There will be no Goddess in this world.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.320
Orchid.

13:49.720 --> 13:50.600
Orchid.

14:09.360 --> 14:10.600
Who are you?

14:19.280 --> 14:21.000
You're still angry with me.

14:21.760 --> 14:23.920
I lied to you and hurt you before.

14:24.560 --> 14:25.880
I've done so many bad things,

14:27.680 --> 14:30.080
making you sad and letting you down.

14:32.200 --> 14:34.040
You should be angry with me.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.360
What are you talking about?

14:36.120 --> 14:37.200
I don't understand.

14:40.280 --> 14:41.120
Orchid.

14:54.840 --> 14:55.880
Stop there.

15:02.160 --> 15:04.040
You're a strange person.

15:04.120 --> 15:05.520
I don't know you at all.

15:05.600 --> 15:07.240
But you keep following me

15:07.320 --> 15:08.960
and saying ridiculous things.

15:09.040 --> 15:10.160
That's so rude.

15:10.240 --> 15:11.320
Orchid.

15:11.400 --> 15:13.000
I know you're still angry.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.960
You can beat me and scold me.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.560
You can even stab me.

15:16.640 --> 15:17.800
If not one stab, then two.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.120
If two don't work, then ten.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.680
As long as you can relieve your anger.

15:21.560 --> 15:23.080
But don't ignore me like this.

15:23.160 --> 15:24.560
I am Xiyun,

15:24.640 --> 15:26.400
the Goddess of the Xilan Tribe,

15:26.480 --> 15:28.160
not Orchid as you call me.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.280
Orchid.

15:36.880 --> 15:39.960
Orchid, it's fine
if you don't want to talk to me.

15:40.560 --> 15:42.280
I will always be here to guard you

15:42.360 --> 15:43.960
until the day you forgive me.

16:27.280 --> 16:28.400
Goddess Chidi.

16:29.080 --> 16:31.040
Fairy Danyin has come to pay her respects.

16:44.040 --> 16:45.240
My lord.

16:50.960 --> 16:52.640
Orchid has lost her memory.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.520
The moment she was reborn,

16:54.600 --> 16:56.600
she said she didn't know me at all.

16:56.680 --> 16:58.800
She also claimed that she is not Orchid.

16:59.760 --> 17:02.560
Could it be that she said that on purpose

17:02.640 --> 17:03.680
out of anger?

17:11.400 --> 17:13.200
At first, I thought so too.

17:13.800 --> 17:15.520
But Orchid is innocent and simple.

17:16.440 --> 17:18.440
She wears her feelings on her sleeve.

17:19.000 --> 17:21.359
Whether she is happy or sad,

17:21.440 --> 17:22.880
I can tell at a glance.

17:23.440 --> 17:25.160
Even if she's angry with me,

17:26.280 --> 17:29.000
she can always find an excuse
in the least time

17:30.040 --> 17:31.560
to forgive me.

17:32.600 --> 17:34.240
But the way she looks at me now

17:35.280 --> 17:36.720
is neither cheerful nor sad,

17:36.800 --> 17:38.640
like she's looking at a stranger.

17:39.200 --> 17:40.320
I feel like…

17:44.240 --> 17:45.880
I feel like she's not angry at all.

17:48.760 --> 17:49.800
She just…

17:57.080 --> 17:58.760
She just doesn't care about me anymore.

18:18.880 --> 18:19.760
My lord.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.800
Don't get too upset.

18:23.280 --> 18:25.520
The fairy may just have
a momentary trauma.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.080
When her spirit is restored,

18:29.040 --> 18:30.200
it'll probably be fine.

18:36.680 --> 18:38.120
It's good for her to forget about it.

18:41.640 --> 18:42.640
Think about it.

18:42.720 --> 18:45.120
I have wronged her, lied to her.

18:45.200 --> 18:47.320
I made her suffer so much
and broke her heart.

18:48.080 --> 18:51.120
Now, she has lost her memory.

18:51.200 --> 18:53.400
The bad memories

18:54.480 --> 18:56.120
would be taken away too, right?

18:58.880 --> 19:00.680
This must be God's will

19:00.760 --> 19:02.640
to bring everything back to square one,

19:02.720 --> 19:04.880
so that I can start over with her.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.240
Shangque.

19:12.320 --> 19:13.640
How do you think

19:13.720 --> 19:16.480
I can make her fall in love with me again?

19:23.640 --> 19:25.200
My lord, you picked morning dew

19:26.160 --> 19:28.960
and cooked flower soup for her
in Shuiyuntian,

19:29.800 --> 19:31.200
helped her with the immortal exam,

19:31.920 --> 19:33.280
and took her to see the sunrise.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.600
She was very touched by all these.

19:36.280 --> 19:39.920
And you also built
an exactly identical Arbiter Hall.

19:40.800 --> 19:41.960
Go on.

19:43.280 --> 19:44.400
Later,

19:45.680 --> 19:47.000
the fairy saved you

19:47.480 --> 19:49.600
and tried to restore your emotional root.

19:50.960 --> 19:53.880
I think that at that time,
she had already fallen in love with you.

19:56.600 --> 19:57.480
All right.

19:58.560 --> 20:00.000
Then I will do the same things again

20:00.640 --> 20:01.680
for her.

20:18.760 --> 20:25.600
ARBITER HALL

20:25.680 --> 20:28.040
ARBITER HALL

20:31.360 --> 20:32.480
What does this mean?

20:34.240 --> 20:37.360
Before this,
I mistook you for an old friend of mine

20:37.440 --> 20:38.480
and intruded on you.

20:39.320 --> 20:41.240
Today, I have moved the hall here

20:41.840 --> 20:43.400
as a token of reparation.

22:10.440 --> 22:11.960
I quite like it here.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.920
Since you like it here,

22:21.000 --> 22:23.680
why don't you live here?

22:31.120 --> 22:32.960
Now that Xishan is in ruins,

22:33.040 --> 22:34.600
you have no one to look after you.

22:35.360 --> 22:38.560
It's fate that I mistook you this time.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.400
If you don't mind,

22:40.480 --> 22:42.600
I am willing

22:42.680 --> 22:44.360
to be your servant.

22:44.440 --> 22:46.880
I wonder if you will allow me.

22:52.320 --> 22:53.720
What is your name?

22:53.800 --> 22:55.040
My name

22:55.880 --> 22:56.920
is Daqiang,

22:57.000 --> 22:59.760
an immortal of Shuiyuntian.

23:02.000 --> 23:02.960
You're lying.

23:04.520 --> 23:06.200
You are not a member of Shuiyuntian.

23:07.560 --> 23:09.800
Goddess, why do you say that?

23:11.280 --> 23:13.240
Have you seen me somewhere before?

23:13.880 --> 23:15.760
You have no immortal aura on you.

23:15.840 --> 23:17.520
You are not immortal.

23:24.200 --> 23:26.600
But Xilan Tribe has been neutral
for generations,

23:27.400 --> 23:29.240
never involved in any disputes.

23:29.320 --> 23:31.800
We treat all beings
in the three realms equally.

23:32.360 --> 23:34.000
I don't care if you are immortal or not.

23:35.080 --> 23:36.920
Since you want to be my servant,

23:37.400 --> 23:38.840
you can stay.

23:41.360 --> 23:42.440
Thank you, Goddess.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.280
Greetings, Goddess.

24:35.600 --> 24:36.520
What is it?

24:41.800 --> 24:44.320
Your spirit is still weak
at the beginning of your transformation.

24:44.920 --> 24:47.720
I've specially made flower soup
with flowers and honey.

24:47.800 --> 24:50.600
It's good for your cultivation
and strengthening of spirit.

24:54.520 --> 24:57.040
And the morning dew is rootless water.

24:57.120 --> 24:59.440
It's the best for your herbaceous spirit.

25:01.920 --> 25:02.960
By the way,

25:03.640 --> 25:05.600
I'm afraid that the coldness of the night

25:05.680 --> 25:07.160
would hurt your body.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.560
So it's already warmed up.

25:09.960 --> 25:11.800
I've also added seven kinds of honey

25:11.880 --> 25:13.440
and six kinds of grass.

25:13.520 --> 25:15.920
You managed to get the water.

25:16.000 --> 25:18.560
I can't casually drink it like this.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.640
What?

25:20.840 --> 25:23.200
Do you want to make a fuss about it?

25:24.680 --> 25:27.240
The water looks tasteless.

25:27.320 --> 25:29.800
I'll get some honey.
Add it to the water and drink it.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.720
That's not necessary.

25:44.480 --> 25:45.920
I'm fasting.

25:46.000 --> 25:48.440
I have no cravings for food and drink.

25:48.960 --> 25:50.760
Besides, I've never liked sweet food.

25:51.280 --> 25:52.200
Take it away.

25:55.040 --> 25:56.480
What are you waiting for?

25:56.560 --> 25:57.800
I know you mean well.

25:58.600 --> 26:00.360
But don't act on your own anymore.

26:04.760 --> 26:05.640
I see.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.400
Drink it.

26:37.480 --> 26:38.400
No.

26:39.640 --> 26:41.520
My lord, you made this for the fairy.

26:41.600 --> 26:43.120
I wouldn't dare.

26:46.760 --> 26:47.760
She doesn't want it.

26:52.000 --> 26:53.960
Just drink it as I told you.

27:04.120 --> 27:05.600
Orchid is right.

27:05.680 --> 27:07.440
She's a goddess now.

27:07.520 --> 27:09.760
The gods don't need such mundane food.

27:10.760 --> 27:11.880
I have to use other methods

27:12.600 --> 27:14.600
to impress her.

27:17.680 --> 27:19.000
Come on.

27:19.080 --> 27:20.880
Think it over for me.

27:20.960 --> 27:23.720
What else did I do to impress her
in the first place?

27:38.640 --> 27:40.160
The fairy enjoys company.

27:40.240 --> 27:42.640
She was always happy
when you were with her.

27:57.320 --> 27:58.840
What again?

28:01.440 --> 28:03.480
I don't want to leave you alone.

28:04.040 --> 28:05.720
So I'm here to accompany you.

28:08.400 --> 28:10.880
I'm a quiet person by nature.

28:11.600 --> 28:13.200
I only feel comfortable when I'm alone.

28:13.280 --> 28:14.800
I never feel lonely.

28:15.600 --> 28:16.560
You may go.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.560
I'll just stay here and meditate.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.440
I won't disturb you.

29:24.560 --> 29:26.680
You've been acting strange all day.

29:26.760 --> 29:27.840
What do you want?

29:28.800 --> 29:29.760
Nothing.

29:29.840 --> 29:31.320
I was just overwhelmed by your beauty

29:31.400 --> 29:33.160
the moment I met you.

29:33.240 --> 29:35.400
I wanted to memorize every word you…

29:36.480 --> 29:37.480
Goddess.

29:39.520 --> 29:41.160
You are really very important

29:41.240 --> 29:42.320
and special to me.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.480
Although I am a Goddess,

29:44.120 --> 29:46.400
I'm just a plant with spiritual wisdom,

29:47.440 --> 29:49.040
like all the others in the three realms.

29:49.840 --> 29:51.400
There is nothing special about me.

29:51.480 --> 29:53.320
I don't think I'm that important.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.880
Wait. I still have something to say.

29:58.560 --> 29:59.480
Since you said

29:59.960 --> 30:01.720
you'd remember everything I say,

30:02.680 --> 30:03.800
do remember,

30:04.360 --> 30:06.360
I don't like to be served by others.

30:06.880 --> 30:08.040
Don't bother me anymore.

30:21.920 --> 30:24.480
I've tried the morning dew
and flower soup.

30:25.680 --> 30:27.400
I've tried companionship too.

30:28.400 --> 30:31.720
I've told her everything
she used to like to hear.

30:35.080 --> 30:35.960
Right.

30:36.840 --> 30:38.600
I can still see the sunrise with her.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.080
My lord.

30:44.040 --> 30:46.800
What? What better way
have you come up with?

30:50.440 --> 30:51.320
My lord.

30:52.520 --> 30:53.600
I think

30:54.680 --> 30:55.920
the Goddess

30:58.080 --> 30:59.360
may no longer be Fairy Orchid.

31:02.120 --> 31:03.000
That's not true.

31:03.760 --> 31:05.440
You've been with the Goddess
for a few days.

31:05.520 --> 31:07.360
I've also observed it for a few days.

31:07.440 --> 31:09.440
The Goddess's expressions,
likes and dislikes,

31:09.520 --> 31:11.080
and behavior

31:11.160 --> 31:13.440
- are completely different from…
- Shut up.

31:22.360 --> 31:24.280
I saw with my own eyes

31:24.360 --> 31:25.880
her spirit turning into an orchid seed.

31:25.960 --> 31:27.760
I planted it with my own hands

31:28.800 --> 31:30.520
and watched her day and night.

31:31.240 --> 31:33.560
So how can she not be Orchid?

31:34.160 --> 31:35.560
- My lord.
- I'm going to sleep.

31:36.240 --> 31:38.480
Tomorrow morning,
I'll watch the sunrise with her.

32:17.880 --> 32:20.720
Right. It's only six in the morning.

32:20.800 --> 32:22.800
Orchid probably hasn't woken up yet.

32:28.480 --> 32:29.440
What are you doing?

32:34.480 --> 32:35.600
Greetings, Goddess.

32:38.280 --> 32:40.640
I told you not to disturb me.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.360
But you're peeping outside the door.

32:43.120 --> 32:44.160
Forgive me, Goddess.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.360
I just want

32:47.040 --> 32:48.760
to invite you

32:48.840 --> 32:51.560
to Xishan's Shaking Light Peak
to watch the sunrise.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.600
I've already checked it out.

32:53.680 --> 32:55.400
It's the highest point on Xishan,

32:55.480 --> 32:58.320
which has the most open and spacious view.

32:59.280 --> 33:00.480
Sunrise?

33:03.240 --> 33:05.360
Do you know it's already seven?

33:05.920 --> 33:08.200
What's wrong with the hour?

33:08.760 --> 33:10.040
Every day at a quarter past dawn,

33:10.520 --> 33:12.720
when the first rays of
the morning sun cover Xishan,

33:12.800 --> 33:14.760
I will meditate at the Shaking Light Peak

33:15.600 --> 33:17.280
and soak in the essence of the sunrise.

33:18.040 --> 33:19.240
You just returned from there?

33:19.720 --> 33:22.360
A practitioner of spirituality
should be diligent and disciplined,

33:23.040 --> 33:24.880
so as not to be as lazy as you are.

34:07.800 --> 34:08.760
My lord.

34:10.159 --> 34:11.120
Eat something.

34:16.600 --> 34:17.560
She really

34:20.320 --> 34:21.760
doesn't seem to be Orchid.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.639
Orchid is a glutton

34:35.800 --> 34:36.880
who likes to have fun

34:37.440 --> 34:38.840
and sleep in.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.639
She is timid,

34:41.520 --> 34:43.960
afraid of the dark and being alone,

34:46.239 --> 34:48.239
but also loves to pretend to be strong.

34:49.239 --> 34:51.239
She suffered

34:51.800 --> 34:53.280
so much for me.

34:55.120 --> 34:57.160
But she still smiled at me.

34:58.760 --> 35:00.160
But the Goddess is different.

35:01.200 --> 35:03.240
The Goddess doesn't like flower soup

35:03.320 --> 35:04.960
nor does she like dew water either.

35:05.480 --> 35:07.200
She doesn't need my company.

35:07.280 --> 35:09.240
She doesn't even like to sleep anymore.

35:09.800 --> 35:11.440
She won't smile at me anymore.

35:11.520 --> 35:14.120
I'm useless around her.

35:22.000 --> 35:24.120
As if I can only disturb her.

35:33.080 --> 35:33.960
Shangque.

35:37.320 --> 35:39.600
Orchid used to ask me

35:41.880 --> 35:44.080
to smile more often.

35:44.960 --> 35:46.800
When you are happy, you should smile.

35:47.520 --> 35:49.800
When you are sad,
you should smile even more.

35:51.520 --> 35:52.680
Because once you smile,

35:53.440 --> 35:54.720
you won't feel sad anymore.

36:02.120 --> 36:03.240
She is not right.

36:15.480 --> 36:16.480
Dongfang Qingcang.

36:20.520 --> 36:22.320
Since Orchid has been reborn,

36:22.400 --> 36:23.880
it's time for you to leave Xishan.

36:24.440 --> 36:25.560
You hurt her so much.

36:26.800 --> 36:28.480
Now she doesn't want to recognize you.

36:29.560 --> 36:31.240
Why do you still stay here and bother her?

36:32.040 --> 36:33.840
She's not Orchid anymore.

36:33.920 --> 36:35.160
What are you saying?

36:35.720 --> 36:36.760
She is

36:40.080 --> 36:41.440
not Orchid anymore.

36:51.600 --> 36:54.000
So you are Changheng,
the youngest son of Lord Dong.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.680
Nice to meet you.

36:56.760 --> 36:57.640
Yes.

36:58.760 --> 36:59.600
I am Changheng.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.800
I can't believe it has been 30,000 years

37:03.320 --> 37:04.960
since my tribe sealed me away.

37:05.800 --> 37:08.720
During these days,
I feel like it was a lifetime ago

37:08.800 --> 37:10.440
whenever I think about it.

37:12.560 --> 37:14.360
The marriage between you and I

37:14.440 --> 37:16.680
has been delayed
for more than 30,000 years.

37:17.760 --> 37:20.080
Now that I've regained my senses,

37:21.320 --> 37:24.240
it's time for the marriage to be settled.

37:28.440 --> 37:29.440
Goddess,

37:30.080 --> 37:31.800
why did you suddenly mention this?

37:31.880 --> 37:33.600
Our Xilan Tribe

37:33.680 --> 37:35.520
and the Lord Dong lineage in Shuiyuntian

37:36.040 --> 37:38.040
have protected
the peace of the three realms.

37:38.600 --> 37:41.640
This has been the contract for generations
since ancient times.

37:42.560 --> 37:44.880
It's also destiny for us to get married.

37:45.440 --> 37:47.040
After we are married,

37:47.520 --> 37:50.160
it'll be our inescapable responsibility

37:50.680 --> 37:53.200
to guard the three realms
and protect the living.

38:05.320 --> 38:06.480
You're pleased, aren't you?

38:10.320 --> 38:11.760
Why should I be pleased?

38:21.720 --> 38:25.520
Orchid has forgotten all about me.

38:26.080 --> 38:28.960
She only remembers she is a Goddess
with whom you have a marriage contract.

38:29.560 --> 38:30.440
I'm sure

38:31.400 --> 38:33.960
you will soon be able to marry her
as you wish.

38:48.640 --> 38:49.680
Dongfang Qingcang.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.440
What kind of person do you take me for?

38:53.160 --> 38:55.680
Do you think I'm happy seeing her now?

38:56.520 --> 38:58.960
You love her. Don't I feel the same?

38:59.040 --> 39:00.280
But at least

39:01.320 --> 39:02.960
you can be with her.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.480
Do you know what you're talking about?

39:09.480 --> 39:12.320
I gave up on her that day in Cangyan Sea
and entrusted her to you.

39:12.400 --> 39:13.400
But what did you do?

39:13.960 --> 39:15.400
Did you protect her well?

39:20.080 --> 39:21.600
Dongfang Qingcang, listen up.

39:23.680 --> 39:24.720
Just like you,

39:26.240 --> 39:27.880
I hope Orchid can come back.

39:39.400 --> 39:41.000
Goddess Chidi, you're so powerful.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.880
As the God of War of Shuiyuntian,

39:42.960 --> 39:44.520
you've never lost a battle.

39:45.040 --> 39:48.000
You're the most merciful, just,
and considerate of the people.

39:48.080 --> 39:49.840
And you never kill innocent people.

39:49.920 --> 39:52.160
I've admired you the most
since I was young.

39:52.240 --> 39:54.000
Now that you've returned to life

39:54.080 --> 39:56.000
and I get to talk to you,

39:56.080 --> 39:58.000
it's like a dream for me.
